---
// A hand-drawn arrow, in the brush hand of the script phrases ("Move forward. Together."), that
// points at the email field of a closing form block (.formband): the waitlist and the Letter.
// Decorative only. Placed by fixes.css in the gap left of the field, from 860px up; below that the
// field sits right under the text and needs no pointer. site.js and motion.css make it write
// itself in when the block comes on screen and nudge toward the field; it steps aside once the
// field has focus or an email. The light displacement roughens the stroke like the brush script.
---
<svg aria-hidden="true" class="nudge" fill="none" focusable="false" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="3.2" viewBox="0 0 58 94"><defs><filter height="120%" id="sw-brush" width="120%" x="-10%" y="-10%"><feTurbulence baseFrequency="1.2" numOctaves="2" seed="3" type="fractalNoise"></feTurbulence><feDisplacementMap in="SourceGraphic" scale="1.6"></feDisplacementMap></filter></defs><g filter="url(#sw-brush)"><path d="M12 3C5 17 7 33 17 39c8 5 15-3 9-8-7-5-15 4-15 17 0 16 14 29 40 31" pathLength="1"></path><path d="M41 70l10 9-11 7" pathLength="1"></path></g></svg>
